@commands `zq makes minecraft:stick`
@pass `creativeengineering:sawmill/recycle_wooden_slab` -> 2, `_stairs` -> 3, `_door` -> 4 sticks
@fails recipe JSONs in `kubejs/data/creativeengineering/recipes/sawmill/`
