## SQ-RW-28 | Dreams & Desires rose, rubber, spirit wood removed (new row, recipes_wood.md 2.6)
@group A
@commands `zq makes create_dd:{rose,rubber,spirit}_planks`; `zq tagsof create_dd:rose_log`
@pass 0 recipes each, no tags; smoked planks keep their recipe
@fails `removed_woods.js` (start and server)
@from batches/r1031/a1_effects.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest makes create_dd:rose_planks
> cdevtest makes create_dd:rubber_planks
> cdevtest makes create_dd:spirit_planks
> cdevtest tagsof create_dd:rose_log
> cdevtest makes create_dd:smoked_planks
expect verb=makes item=create_dd:rose_planks n=0
expect verb=makes item=create_dd:rubber_planks n=0
expect verb=makes item=create_dd:spirit_planks n=0
# item tags only since r1118 (judge-8, 2026-11-18): removed items lose item tags (removed_item_tags.js); block tags stay, the blocks never generate
reject verb=tagsof id=create_dd:rose_log .*item_tags=(?!-)\S
reject verb=makes item=create_dd:smoked_planks n=0
kjsreject (removed_woods\.js).*(Error|error)
look smoked planks keep their own recipe (RW-23); the JEI half is RW-28 in the client block
