## SQ-TL-09 | /cegen lists the generators
@group A
@commands `/cdevgen` (op, console)
@pass lists 63 generators from `tools/generators.json` with their groups (`stacks` among them) and the last run; no `[cdevgen]` error in `latest.log`
@fails pack_tooling.md TL-09, TODO `tooling/generators-and-tests #1`
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# srv/ has no tools/ (GeneratorRunner reads tools/generators.json from the server root): copy the manifest in, r1126q s12
shell mkdir -p tools && cp "$INST/tools/generators.json" tools/ && echo copied
> cdevgen
sleep 3
reject \[(cegen|cdevgen)\].*(Error|error|failed)
reject Unknown or incomplete command
look the chat line `63 generators in tools/generators.json` and one line per generator with its groups (stacks among them)

## SQ-JRFTL-01 (r1101 PASS)
@group A
@commands after JRFTL jar is out of mods/: `/give @s jrftl:prepared_flesh`; creosote filling and IE bottling on rotten flesh; smoke it
@pass item exists with the new texture and name "Prepared Flesh"; recipes work; smoking gives leather; no jrftl errors in latest.log
@fails `misc_items.js`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootreject (?i)(ERROR|Exception).*jrftl
> cdevtest item jrftl:prepared_flesh
> cdevtest makes jrftl:prepared_flesh
> cdevtest uses jrftl:prepared_flesh
expect verb=item item=jrftl:prepared_flesh class=
expect verb=makes id=\S+ result=jrftl:prepared_flesh\S* serializer=create:filling
expect verb=makes id=\S+ result=jrftl:prepared_flesh\S* serializer=immersiveengineering:bottling_machine
expect verb=uses id=\S+ alone=\S+ serializer=minecraft:smoking
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0
look the smoking recipe makes leather (rdetail the id from the uses line if unsure); name "Prepared Flesh" and the new texture are client looks (JEI)
